     5592             end.
     5593              if mFrameView
     5594              then do:
     5595               DISPLAY
     5596                 n-nm @ RecordsDone
     5597                 WITH FRAME InfoFrame.
     5598              end.
     5599   End.
     5600      if v-button-stop then  DO:
     5601            if mFrameView
     5602            then
     5603               PROCESS EVENTS.
     5604            IF StopProcessing THEN DO:
